Package: capeloopconfirmatory
Type: Project
Title: CAPE-Loop Confirmatory Mixed-Effects Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("CAPE-Loop", "Contributors", role = "aut")
Description: Reproducible, fail-closed mixed-effects analyses for the two
    confirmatory formulas declared in the CAPE-Loop proposal. This project is
    an analysis harness and does not contain or manufacture study results.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
